<title>EGYPT: Egypt share index rises to two-week record high.</title>
<headline>Egypt share index rises to two-week record high.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's all-share index added to a two-week record run on Wednesday and rose 1.27 percent to close at 399.6 points, the Capital Markets Authority said.</p>
<p>It said the index rose 5.0 points from 394.6 points on Tuesday. Wednesday's level is the 14th record high for the index in as many days.</p>
